The ICmdHelper interface or class is not directly visible in the Commands folder either. Since the CmdHelper is a dependency injected into DotnetEfToolManager, I will create a mock for it in the test. The key method to mock is RunCmdAndGetOutput(string) which returns a string, and RunCmd(string) which returns void.

I will proceed to write the xUnit test file for DotnetEfToolManager focusing on the coverage of the Logger.LogInformation calls on line 37 and 39. I will mock the CmdHelper to simulate the tool not installed and verify the logger calls.

